{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110405001:0":{"text":"거기 서! 누구야? 어디서 왔고 어디로 가는 거지?","source_cn":"站住。你们是谁？哪儿来的？要去哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5636648B508421D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1110405001":{"text":"거기 서! 누구야? 어디서 왔고 어디로 가는 거지?","source_cn":"站住。你们是谁？哪儿来的？要去哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5636648B508421D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110405002:0":{"text":"석양 전투장? 군가 축제가 곧 시작될 텐데, 시련에 참가한 용사들인가?","source_cn":"残阳武斗场？战歌节要开始了，你们难道是参赛的勇士？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E185F591B089E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110405003:0":{"text":"...맞아요, 우리는 군가 축제 참가자들이에요.","source_cn":"……是的，我们是战歌节的参赛者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D19923E1C0070D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110405006:1":{"text":"너희는 아직 승인받지 못하고 시련 중이라고 들었는데?","source_cn":"我怎么听说你们还在试炼，没有获得承认呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B6A258FEF1E030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110405007:0":{"text":"우리는 반드시 참가 자격을 받을 거예요.","source_cn":"我们一定会获得参赛资格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06027A3879962C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110405008:0":{"text":"대단한 포부군! 그런데 넌 어딘가 낯이 익은데. 우리 부족에서 버림받은 나약한 트라이브랑 닮은 것 같아...","source_cn":"好大的口气！不过，你小子好像有点眼熟。和我们族内被抛弃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB377441FE585E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110405009:0":{"text":"맞아, 털도 별로 없이 민둥민둥했던...","source_cn":"没错，生下来光秃秃的，浑身没几根熊毛——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71ED44C655DC83C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110405010:0":{"text":"너...","source_cn":"你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3870CC3BBD1E5162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110405011:0":{"text":"소렌, 진정해!","source_cn":"索恩，冷静！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0F7DB7ADC0B84F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110405012:1":{"text":"...휴, 굳이 옛날이야기는 할 필요 없어요. 전 그저 이 길을 지나가고 싶을 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"……呼，你们没必要跟我叙旧。我们只想借个路，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE77AE91E61BEE3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110405013:0":{"text":"아니, 그건 안 돼. 넌 약하게 태어난데다 지금도 덩치가 크지 않은데, 그런 네가 군가 축제의 참가자라고?","source_cn":"不，不行。你不老实。生下来就是弱者，长到现在块头也不大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA658ADEBD0552A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110405014:0":{"text":"그래. 거짓말하는 수상한 사람은 정확히 조사해야 해. 따라와!","source_cn":"没错，对撒谎的可疑人士，必须带走好好盘查。跟我们走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9477BEED2B82B8C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110405015:0":{"text":"무슨 소리에요! 다 알고 있잖아요! 그렇지 않으면 사람을 보내서 우리 부족 사람을 괴롭힐 리가 없죠!","source_cn":"别开玩笑了，你们明明什么都知道！不然，怎么会派人去骚扰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7623D415AD937179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110405016:0":{"text":"이런 비열한 핑계로 우리를 잡아두려 하다니... 우리가 겁먹을 줄 알아요?","source_cn":"现在竟然想用这种差劲借口扣下我们——是觉得我们会怕吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285ADB5E0002F888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110405017:0":{"text":"소렌, 진정해! 여긴 블랙하울의 영지야. 경거망동해선 안 돼!","source_cn":"索恩，别冲动！这里是他们的领地，我们不能轻举妄动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2582AE0813C75735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110405018:0":{"text":"지금 일을 키우면 시련을 놓칠 수도 있어! 아버지와의 약속만 생각해!","source_cn":"现在把事情闹大，我们可能会错过试炼的！想想和老爹的约定吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x740ED34D4DA0AB41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110405019:0":{"text":"... 알겠어, 아르사.","source_cn":"……我明白了，阿尔萨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA58968B56CC47DB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110405020:0":{"text":"이제 좀 말이 통하는군. 훨씬 수월해졌어! 녀석들을 영지로 데리고 가!","source_cn":"乖乖得多好啊，省了我们多少事！走，带这些人去主营！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1E220112FA72B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"석양 전투장에서 왔어","source_cn":"残阳武斗场来的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD0801229DD2D2AAD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"석양 전투장에서 왔어","female":"석양 전투장에서 왔어","variant_male_record_index":"63204","variant_female_record_index":"63205","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110405004:0":{"text":"군신의 봉우리? 군가 축제의 용사 외에는 아무도 그곳에 갈 수 없어.","source_cn":"战神峰？除了战歌节的勇士们，没人能去战神峰。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3628F86751EAE578","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"군신의 봉우리? 군가 축제의 용사 외에는 아무도 그곳에 갈 수 없어.","female":"군신의 봉우리? 군가 축제의 용사 외에는 아무도 그곳에 갈 수 없어.","variant_male_record_index":"120949","variant_female_record_index":"120950","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110405005:0":{"text":"...맞아요. 저와 아르사는 군가 축제 참가자에요.","source_cn":"……就像你说的，我和阿尔萨是战歌节的参赛者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0583C35BC373446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"우린 군신의 봉우리 산기슭에 가야 해","source_cn":"要去战神峰山脚","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAA85AD8041E784A9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우린 군신의 봉우리 산기슭에 가야 해","female":"우린 군신의 봉우리 산기슭에 가야 해","variant_male_record_index":"63206","variant_female_record_index":"63207","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮横的黑嚎守卫":{"text":"난폭한 블랙하울 수비병","source":"蛮横的黑嚎守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:挑衅的黑嚎守卫":{"text":"도발적인 블랙하울 수비병","source":"挑衅的黑嚎守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":4}}